{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A lazy sequence of the entities that match a query, with the components the query reads."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryView"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You get a view from a world’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"query(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" methods. Each row is a tuple of the entity, labeled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entity"},{"type":"text","text":", followed by the values of the query’s terms in the order the query lists them, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loop can name them all:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"comet\"), Velocity(dx: 3, dy: 4))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"statue\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 1), Frozen())","","for (_, name, velocity) in world.query(Name.self, Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self) {","    print(name.value, velocity.dx)","    \/\/ Prints \"comet 3.0\"","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A view is a snapshot of the world it came from: changing the world while you iterate doesn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change what the view shows, though the first write to each component type copies that type’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"storage. To change components while you visit them, use one of the world’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"update","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" methods","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Narrow a view with the same methods a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" offers, such as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/with(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/without(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Each returns a new view."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Rows come in the order of the list the view walks: the storage of the queried or required type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that the fewest entities hold, or a shorter list where one applies, such as a target’s sources","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/related(_:to:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or a cached query’s entities. That order depends only on the steps that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"built the world, so it’s the same every time you run the same steps.","type":"text"}]}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Querying and Updating Entities","anchor":"Querying-and-Updating-Entities","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityQueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryRow","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/Wor